  "title": "New Human Interest Report Reveals The Power of Retirement Plan Access for Hourly Workers",
  "summary": "Human Interest, Retirement Industry Disruptor<sup>TM</sup>, today released a new report quantifying the massive impact that access to employer-sponsored retirement plans could have on more than 80 million hourly workers in America.<sup>1</sup> The findings reveal a dramatic and solvable gap: when hourly workers have access to a retirement plan, 82% participate and save; without access, 75% save nothing at all.",
